and some more general quality of life improvements. I hope you enjoy th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T22:40:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685744","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1836506165566562","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"update","title":"1.3 Update is Here! - Movement Overhaul, Better Temples, More Details.","summary":"1.3 Update is Here!Movement Overhaul, Better Temples, More Details.Hello Everyone!This is a massive update this time, loads of new content has been added. There's overhauled movement mechanics, new blocks, overhauled temples, and grapple hooks!You can also now actually crawl in the game called \"Crawl to the Depths\". About time! Why didn't I call the game \"Call to the Depths\" by the way, isn't that a lot cooler sounding? I have no idea. Beats me. Oh well, can't change it now!Anyway, onto the patc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T22:28:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165566562","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1834602721197158","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.2 Update","summary":"GeneralAdded objective marker to make it easier to find the exit made purple mushrooms more bouncy :) made mineshaft staircases less frustrating to climb reverted intro button back to tutorial button Added brandingReplaced placeholder icons for a few abilities Balance ChangesMade default difficulty easier (You can revert this by using the bronze difficulty). This is more experimental so I reserve the right to change this laterNerfed fireball spellMade tornado spell hopefully a little more consis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T21:46:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197158","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1834602721194750","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.1 Hotfix","summary":"Hi Everyone, this is just a small patch to fix a critical issue relating to the last update. The game should be able to launch on all platforms now.Cheers!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T20:42:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1834602721194452","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2.0 Patch Notes","summary":"Hi all,Thank you to everyone who's played the demo so far and helped with reporting any issues that you have encountered. This update is aimed to fix those issues as well as doing a lot of reworking to the game's balance which I promised in the last update.Patch NotesBalance ChangesI have completely overhauled a the games balance to make the game a little easier and more forgiving to the player.Damage falloff now works correctly and is a lot less severe, the revolver damage for example is a lot ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T18:22:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1833968530889593","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"update","title":"Update demo1.1.0 is here with an overhauled tutorial!","summary":"Demo1.1.0 - Tutorial OverhaulHello everyone!Since the demo launched I have been hard at work on fixing bugs and making quality of life improvements. New content might slow down for a bit after this update because I am moving houses at the moment but I should be able to get back to work on the demo soon. Steam allows you to hook up some stats to games to see roughly where people were getting stuck and/or dying, and I found that a majority of people were getting stuck or quitting at the tutorial. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T22:34:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889593","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1833334318579352","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix demo1.0.2","summary":"Hello All,A small hotfix for the demo is now live. This aims to fix a few minor bugs and issues people were having. The patch notes can be seen below:Patch Notes-Heavily reduced player suffocation damage-Made enemy spawning more consistent-Fixed incorrect enemy spawn rates-Fixed a bug where you could clip through the ground by placing blocks whilst falling-You can now start a new run without playing the tutorial first-Set the default FPS Cap to 150Known IssuesTemporary stuttering when playing th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T13:18:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318579352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1833334318578123","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"announcement","title":"A Demo for Crawl To The Depths is now Available!","summary":"Hello all! I just wanted to make a quick annoncement that a demo of Crawl to the Depths is now ready to play!I have been working hard on this game so I'm very happy to releasing a demo to the public. For now I will be working on bug fixes, new content, and promoting the game to streamers.Whats in the demo?Right now there are:3 Levels7 Weapon Upgrades12 Enemies14 SpellsThe possibility of a few bugs or issues (let me know on discord!)The length of the game is roughly 20-100 minutes from start to f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-25T22:01:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318578123","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188500-1830797770240951","game_id":"steam-4188500","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Launch & Updates on release date","summary":"Hi everyone,I wanted to make a quick announcement about the games release date and a new demo on Steam that should be coming soon. I'm going to be as transparent as possible just so everyone is correctly informed on the state of the game at the moment as well. Firstly, in terms of the game's development itself, things are going pretty smoothly. Feedback from a small group of playtesters has gone well, and the first section of the game is almost complete. I am mostly working on polish, bug fixes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-26T21:47:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770240951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4188500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4188500":"2026-10-26T01:48:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4188500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:20Z","last_